ily:MercuryTextG2\">Ten-Characters Methodology</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2589-magnum-opus","name":"Magnum Opus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2589_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"821"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-17T12:41:13-07:00","id":952677,"title":"","content":"The Night Horrors book (that could also expand on existing antagonist splats like Centimani and Alchemists) with weird things like the Zeky.<br /> <br /> A Player's Guide primarily exploring the Lineages and Refinements (also bring back the Device Merit... Maybe rename it Component and let it take other forms for other Lineages).<br /> <br /> A Storyteller's Guide focused on constructing the Pilgrimage and Principle-related-mysteries.<br /> <br /> A different full length Storyteller aimed book for hacks and alternate settings (time jumping via Azothic memory? Future setting where artificial constructs and grown people go mainstream? Playing up the isolation via always visible disfigurements? Etc etc)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":1098,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","user":"glamourweaver","date":". 08-17-2016, 04:15 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[