inyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-17T18:47:15-07:00","id":952911,"title":"","content":"just off the top of my head:<br /> 1. A Chronicler's Guide<br /> 2. A book on How Roles and the pilgrimage can be adapted to new shard (post-apocalyptic, revealed, space opera, etc.) 3. Pandoran Creation Guide that focuses on &quot;weirder&quot; genrative acts like anatomicical separation and similar surgeries.<br /> 4. A &quot;Dead Flesh&quot; line that acts as a short of book of the dead update that gives a travellouge of different entities other then Ghosts &amp; Kerberoi that prometheans might encounter in the underworld. maybe split into 2 books (one for ghosts &amp; another for dead supernaturals in the underworld).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/885-bwgustaf","name":"bwgustaf","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-17T20:33:54-07:00","id":952955,"title":"","content":"I'm strangely satisfied with what we already have. I guess I'd like to see some of the weirdness get played up, with clones and Zeky back. More Merits and Dread Powers, to be sure.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>LFP: Foreign Bodies (Deviant: the Renegades)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/969-verge","name":"Verge","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"378"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-18T07:47:31-07:00","id":953167,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Magnum Opus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/948269-2e-promethean-supplements?p=952546#post952546\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> You mean <a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/pdf/PtC/PtC_2ndED_Official_2-Page_Interactive.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">like this</a>?</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, pretty much just like that. I must have a bookmark to an old Mr. Gone page, as 2nd edition stuff wasn't showing up there.<br /> <br /> However, it looks like this sheet isn't finished. Still needs to add fillable text boxes for merits, transmutations, etc.<br /> <br /> But I can do that myself. I could just never figure out how to do the dots.<br /> <br /> Thanks for the correct link.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10978-azenogoth","name":"Azenogoth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10978_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"59"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-19T03:59:50-07:00","id":953750,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dataweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/948269-2e-promethean-supplements?p=948323#post948323\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>Pandora's Book</b>: not just Centimani, Pandorans, <i>qashmallim</i>, and Firestorms; but also Zeka, more nuanced and detailed alchemists, homunculi, beast-men from the Isle of Dr. Moreau, etc. The <b>Night Horrors</b> book.</div> </div> </div> </div>Sounds good to me. Matt suggested that an expanded treatment of alchemists might find its way into a player's guide instead, but this seems like the better place for them. Clones could make a comeback here as well.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <b>Strange Alchemies</b>: optional rules for Constructed Prometheans; more Bestowments and an expanded system for Bestowments (and Boons?) designed to allow for more fine-tuning of the Lineages and to provide for an easier hook for adding new powers to the game; more Roles per Refinement; more Alembics per Transmutation; a closer look at Athanors; more Azothic Items. The Player's Guide. </div> </div> </div>I'm not sure about more Alembics for each Transmutation, as the number seems to work with the Pilgrimmage pretty well (and one for each of the big four elements seems like a good fit - though I guess that also makes a case for a fifth). I like the rest, especially Roles.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <b>Magnum Opus: </b>the <b>World of Darkness: Mirrors</b> of the <b>Promethean</b> line, with rules variants and setting shards. The Chronicler's Guide. </div> </div> </div>The kinds of encounter - both of places and people - you find in Midnight Roads would go well here. The game might not demand nomadism as much as the first edition, but it's still likely to be a big deal.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/948269-2e-promethean-supplements?p=948408#post948408\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Elan Vital must be a name.<br /> <br /> I would not object to it being the name for an alchemist and demiurge book, though I imagine better can be done.<br /> <br /> Imposter Syndrome would be a cool Players Guide.</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;The Burning World&quot; should be a title of at least a chapter.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":321,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/321-sunlessnick","user":"SunlessNick","date":". 08-19-2016, 07:02 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/321-sunlessnick","name":"SunlessNick","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1214"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}